      <div class="project-overlay">
        <div>
          <p class="project-overlay-label">Key Features</p>
          <ul class="project-feature-list">
            <li>External XML-style data import with parser and client layer</li>
            <li>Validation before database writes to handle unreliable input</li>
            <li>PostgreSQL schema with SQLAlchemy models and Alembic migrations</li>
            <li>Duplicate-safe sync by external BoardGameGeek ID</li>
            <li>Import-run and error tracking for reviewable sync results</li>
            <li>Report endpoints for family-friendly and accessible games</li>
            <li>Automated tests plus live Swagger/OpenAPI documentation</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="project-overlay-actions">
